---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/sections/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="eHack Academy Case Study — Ascendrow" description="From Zero to ₹22.5L+ in Monthly Program Sales: Building a Cybersecurity Acquisition Funnel from Scratch">
  <main>
    <section
      style="background-color: #6E56CF; min-height: 100vh; position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: clamp(120px, 10vw, 160px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px) clamp(64px, 8vw, 120px); color: #F8F7FB; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;"
    >
      <!-- Matte Noisy Texture -->
      <div 
        style="position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0.3; mix-blend-mode: overlay; pointer-events: none; background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noise%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.8%22 numOctaves=%224%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noise)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E');"
      ></div>

      <!-- Back Button -->
      <div style="position: relative; max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto 32px auto;">
        <a href="/case-studies" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#FFF'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(255,255,255,0.7)'">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
            <path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
          Back to Case Studies
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- The Frame -->
      <div style="position: relative; max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); padding: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px); background: rgba(15, 15, 20, 0.05); border-radius: 8px;">
        
        <!-- Top Center Headline -->
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px);">
          <h1 style="font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 25ch; text-wrap: balance; text-align: center; color: #FFF;">
            Building a complete cybersecurity acquisition funnel from <span style="color: #FF6B4A;">scratch.</span>
          </h1>
        </div>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px); align-items: start;">
          
          <!-- Left side: Metadata & Paragraph -->
          <div>
            <!-- Structured Metadata List -->
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03)); backdrop-filter: blur(16px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); box-shadow: 0 12px 40px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding: 32px; border-radius: 12px; max-width: 400px; margin-bottom: 48px; position: relative; z-index: 10;">
              
              <!-- Client -->
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
                <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #A895FF; font-weight: 600;">Client</span>
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #FFF;">
                  <div style="background: #FFF; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                    <img src="/brands/white-academy.png" alt="eHack Academy Logo" style="height: 24px; width: auto; max-width: 120px; object-fit: contain; display: block;" />
                  </div>
                  <span>eHack Academy</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Role -->
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
                <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #A895FF; font-weight: 600;">Role</span>
                <div style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #FFF;">
                  Tech & Performance Marketing
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Contact -->
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
                <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #A895FF; font-weight: 600;">Point of Contact</span>
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #FFF;">
                  <img src="https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Pranshav+Vyas&background=FF6B4A&color=FFF&bold=true" alt="Pranshav Vyas" style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; display: block;" />
                  <span>Pranshav Vyas</span>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>

            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px;">
              <div>
                <h3 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFF; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The Starting Point</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
                  When we started working with this EdTech company, there was no proper digital acquisition system in place. There was no clear brand positioning, no defined digital funnel, and no active paid acquisition strategy.
                </p>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin: 0;">
                  The website was not generating meaningful inquiries, and there was no structured journey to take a potential student from awareness to enrollment. We started from zero, focusing on building a complete acquisition funnel for their cybersecurity programs—from the first ad impression to the final enrollment.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FF6B4A; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">The Result</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
                  The complete funnel helped turn a previously inactive digital presence into a working student acquisition system. The <strong>Job Ready Program</strong>, priced at ₹1.5 lakh, became the primary conversion driver.
                </p>
                <div style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFF; margin-bottom: 8px;">15+ <span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #A895FF;">Sales / Month</span></div>
                <div style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFF; margin-bottom: 8px;">₹22.5L+ <span style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #A895FF;">Monthly Revenue</span></div>
                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin: 0;">(15 × ₹1,50,000 = ₹22,50,000)</p>
              </div>
              
              <div>
                <h3 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFF; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The Bigger Picture</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin: 0;">
                  This was not just a landing page project. It was about creating the system that connects positioning, advertising, landing pages, retargeting and automation into one customer journey. From zero acquisition infrastructure to ₹22.5 lakh+ in monthly program sales.
                </p>
              </div>
              
              <!-- Images supplied by user -->
              <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px;">
                <img src="/mockups/job-ready-promote.png" alt="Job Ready Promotion" style="width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);" />
                <img src="/mockups/diploma-ss.png" alt="Diploma Screenshot" style="width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);" />
              </div>
              
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Right side: UX-Optimized Timeline/List of Results -->
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px; position: relative;">
            
            <!-- The connecting line -->
            <div style="position: absolute; left: 7px; top: 10px; bottom: 10px; width: 2px; background: rgba(168, 149, 255, 0.3);"></div>

            <!-- Result 1 -->
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px; position: relative;">
              <div style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF6B4A; border: 3px solid #6E56CF; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 107, 74, 0.4); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 6px; position: relative; z-index: 2;"></div>
              <div>
                <h3 style="font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px); font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px 0; line-height: 1.2; color: #FFF;">
                  01 — Positioning & Messaging
                </h3>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); margin: 0;">
                  Before running campaigns, we worked on how the cybersecurity programs should be presented to the market. Instead of simply selling courses, we positioned the programs around the user's career goals, problems and desired outcomes. This gave the ads, landing pages and follow-up communication one consistent message.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Result 2 -->
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px; position: relative;">
              <div style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF6B4A; border: 3px solid #6E56CF; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 107, 74, 0.4); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 6px; position: relative; z-index: 2;"></div>
              <div>
                <h3 style="font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px); font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px 0; line-height: 1.2; color: #FFF;">
                  02 — Meta Awareness
                </h3>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); margin: 0;">
                  We launched Meta campaigns to introduce the cybersecurity programs to the right audience and create awareness. The goal was not to immediately sell. It was to build a relevant audience that could later be moved deeper into the funnel.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Result 3 -->
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px; position: relative;">
              <div style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF6B4A; border: 3px solid #6E56CF; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 107, 74, 0.4); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 6px; position: relative; z-index: 2;"></div>
              <div>
                <h3 style="font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px); font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px 0; line-height: 1.2; color: #FFF;">
                  03 — Google High-Intent Acquisition
                </h3>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); margin: 0;">
                  We then used Google Ads to capture users who were already searching for cybersecurity education and career opportunities. This allowed us to target users with stronger purchase intent rather than relying only on cold audiences.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Result 4 -->
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px; position: relative;">
              <div style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF6B4A; border: 3px solid #6E56CF; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 107, 74, 0.4); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 6px; position: relative; z-index: 2;"></div>
              <div>
                <h3 style="font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px); font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px 0; line-height: 1.2; color: #FFF;">
                  04 — Conversion-Focused Landing Pages
                </h3>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); margin: 0 0 12px 0;">
                  We created dedicated landing page experiences for the cybersecurity programs. Each page was designed around a simple journey: <strong>Problem → Desired Outcome → Solution → Program → Proof/Trust → Action</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); margin: 0;">
                  We strategically promoted the <strong>Job Ready Program</strong> as the primary solution. This became the key revenue-driving program, priced at ₹1.5 lakh.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Result 5 -->
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px; position: relative;">
              <div style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF6B4A; border: 3px solid #6E56CF; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 107, 74, 0.4); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 6px; position: relative; z-index: 2;"></div>
              <div>
                <h3 style="font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px); font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px 0; line-height: 1.2; color: #FFF;">
                  05 — Retargeting
                </h3>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); margin: 0;">
                  Not every visitor was ready to enroll on the first visit. So we built retargeting campaigns across Meta and Google to bring interested users back. Users who had already interacted with the brand or website were shown relevant follow-up messaging.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Result 6 -->
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px; position: relative;">
              <div style="width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF6B4A; border: 3px solid #6E56CF; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 107, 74, 0.4); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 6px; position: relative; z-index: 2;"></div>
              <div>
                <h3 style="font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px); font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px 0; line-height: 1.2; color: #FFF;">
                  06 — Email & Automation
                </h3>
                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); margin: 0;">
                  The funnel continued even after the user left the website. We built email follow-up and automation flows to keep potential students engaged, answer their questions and move them closer to enrollment. This connected the different parts of the funnel.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
